  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - ASEAN DISASTER MANAGEMENT, MITIGATION, AND RESPONSE TECHNOLOGIES WORKSHOP, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $298,538 Technical Symposium promotes the best practices and use of U.S. disaster management, response and mitigation technologies in Southeast Asian countries. The workshop focuses on matching Southeast Asian project sponsors in the disaster management sector with U.S. providers of information and communications technology (ICT) solutions and services. The workshop also provides a venue for governments and relevant industries to have dialogue on advancing operational procedures, guidance for disaster and emergency management and training services.</narrative>
  </description>
